WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.310
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.970
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.580
The chefs were in a hard battle 
against the attacking Gourmet Corp.!

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:14.650
Meanwhile, NEO,

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.040
a third organization with different 
goals than IGO and Gourmet Corp.,

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.780
was about to make their move!

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:23.590
And while Toriko fought 
desperately against Starjun,

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:26.460
Komatsu hurried over to him.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.360
Counterattack! Zebra Starts Up!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.330
Cooking Island...

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:45.880
The chefs' holy ground...

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.410
It's a wreck.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:53.880
Huh?

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.410
How did we get off the island?

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.720
It was Zebra!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:00.630
Yeah. It had to be!

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:01.870
Munage-san!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.620
In the moment we were blown off the island,

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.480
I heard his voice!

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.370
What a paragon of a newscaster! 
He's still holding the mic!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.910
You bastards are in the way!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.230
...he said.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.430
I take back the paragon thing.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.610
I'm Zebra...

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.680
You don't sound even one gram like him!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.960
I'll eat you!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.850
Chef Yuda!

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.230
Honor the Food!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.200
Cherry Blossom Fervent Dance!

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.790
How strong are they?!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:14.290
Even after hitting them with all these 
skills, we're still no match for them?!

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:20.550
Nitro...

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.980
I never thought it would come to this.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:29.280
Hey, don't kill 'em, Nitro!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.750
The goal is to kidnap the chefs!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.630
Just wound 'em if you have to!

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.670
W-Wait a second!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.200
I don't have the strength to dodge them.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.810
This is the end of the line?

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:14.510
Death Sound.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:29.070
There are some cocky bastards here.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.710
Z-Zebra!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.530
You wanna die that badly, 
I'll drive ya to extinction!

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.020
Come an' get me!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.480
Zonge-sama, it isn't safe here!

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.100
Let's make our getaway!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.120
What are you talkin' about?!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.040
If I leave now, it'll halve 
our side's fighting strength!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.940
Um, I really don't think 
it'll make much difference...

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.210
Excuse me? What's that?!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.260
Did you just say somethin'?!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.580
I'm not sure it would make much difference...

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.030
That's twice you said it!

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:09.650
I hate you!

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.300
Zonge-sama, I like you.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.090
I respect you.

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:16.590
If I weren't traveling with you,

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:20.400
I'm sure I'd be spending my entire 
life back at the lonely village.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.120
I see...

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.390
Good point.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:27.140
I never would've been able to go on 
an adventurous journey like this.

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:29.770
Y-You guys...

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.130
You guys!

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.780
I love ya!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.180
My true subordinates! No, my friends!

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.420
Zonge-sama!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.480
I got it!

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:41.510
Listen! I'm used to fights 
like this from video games!

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.550
I gotta start by beatin' the boss class!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.160
Brave hero of the journey, Zonge-sama!

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:50.860
Please beat that thing!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:54.050
No, no, no! Impossible! 
Preposterous! Reckless!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.060
I've got a stomachache in my 
head, so I'm takin' the day off!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.440
My true friends!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.230
Zonge-sama!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.170
It was a good life!

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.700
I know, right?!

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.930
Dear me...

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:15.460
These monsters think they own the place...

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:18.730
Gourmet National Treasure-san?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.450
She's close!

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:27.860
Here, leave the rest to me 
and get away while you can.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:30.010
W-We will, Granny!

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.150
Let's go, you guys!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.340
We're really going to just run away?

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.350
The old lady said to leave it to her!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:43.240
You gotta listen to the elderly!

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:45.440
That's what the village 
elder always used to say!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.190
Right?!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.310
Right! That's our Zonge-sama!

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.220
I think I'll just take 
a moment to finish this.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:03.290
Jumbo Pressure Cooker!

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.920
Air pressure...

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:23.250
You cooked them in a flash with high 
pressure, just like in a pressure cooker.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.070
Chiyo...

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.640
National Treasure Setsuno...

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:35.730
Although if you weren't around, I'm 
sure that title would belong to me.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.960
You've fallen,

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.130
Chiyo...

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.200
I haven't "fallen".

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.810
I've gone on to the next stage.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:55.410
There was a time when we were called rivals.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.820
If possible, I wanted to have 
a cooking showdown with you.

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.720
Is he going to give it his all too?

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:05.720
I got all the spectators outta here.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:09.370
Even so, if I do my worst, 
people are gonna feel it.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.740
Ah, well...

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.090
So you wanna do this?

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:18.070
You're the cockiest bastard of the bunch!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.370
Zebra!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.540
Voice Press!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.620
Beat Punch!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.620
Scum should just shut up an' take a dirt nap!

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.130
Let's play,

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.620
leapin' lizards!

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.580
Huh? You're already done, girl?

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.160
You're the ones that are done!

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.500
It's hard to control this...

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.190
...so I wanted to avoid using it,

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.390
but you leave me no choice!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.460
Fragrance Sword! Perfume max!

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:34.550
You won't wake up for a month,

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.240
so good night!

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.580
Another skillful technique?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.420
Your deal is building up anger, right?

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.860
But you don't got that kind of time now.

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:49.760
Before you can build up anger, 
I'll make mincemeat out of you!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.950
Mince Head!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:03.180
I was told that Century Soup 
activated my Gourmet Cells.

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.570
Century Soup...

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.100
It's the flavor of all 
life from the ancient past

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.520
linking us to the next life.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.590
It ain't a tool to help you in battle.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:18.590
It's the flavor of gratitude towards life.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:36.200
Next time around, make 
sure you savor the flavor.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:39.150
Be grateful for the taste 
that connects you to life.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:46.780
I met your friends before.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:50.520
Now let's have a little fun one-on-one!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.360
Pretty strong...

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.870
Machine Gun Voice!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:33.770
Voice Burst!

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:54.380
Sound Knuckle!

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.160
At the speed of sound!

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:06.140
He took out the Nitro just like that...

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.940
Sound Bazooka!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:30.330
And that's the end of that.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.630
But even aside from Gourmet Corp.,

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:36.930
there are some cocky 
bastards around here, huh?

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.040
What's wrong, Chiyo?

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:52.370
You're breathing heavy.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:54.680
You're lowering air pressure, aren't you?

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:56.980
That's right.

00:13:57.760 --> 00:14:00.480
The atmosphere is similar to a mountain peak

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.150
at an elevation of 10,000 meters.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:07.580
An average human couldn't even 
take one step in those conditions,

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.060
but look at you...

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:12.370
It shows your mastery of 
Honoring the Food, Chiyo.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:16.030
I think lowering air pressure was a mistake.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:37.070
You're fast.

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:41.060
The lower the air pressure, 
the less air resistance,

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.590
so movements become faster.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:45.910
Add speed to my delicacy

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.170
and nothing can stop me!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.400
I don't know about that...

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.440
Your movements are quicker,

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:54.410
but so are mine!

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:01.040
Gourmet National Treasure Setsuno...

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.560
May we be your opponents as well?

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.360
Art of the Meal! Calorie Consumption!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.790
Kuribo and Sage Kosai!

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.530
What are you two...?

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.040
Single Slice...

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.640
...Samsara Sever!

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:32.360
It only cut Setsuno in his hand!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.440
That must be...

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:35.170
...the Cooking King, Zaus!

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:37.980
How many decades... No...

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:42.960
How many centuries has it 
been since I last bled?

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:48.540
Well, what on Earth is the 
meaning of this, Kuribo?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:50.850
Depending on your answer,

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:55.020
a terrible punishment may be waiting...

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:56.370
...for all of you brats!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.100
My Gimmick Spatula...

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.180
No matter how much pressure is put on it,

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:09.820
it won't bend a single millimeter, but...

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:13.930
I easily siphoned ten million kilocalories,

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:16.250
but it hasn't had any effect on her.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.920
National Treasure Setsuno,

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.790
you have an untold amount of energy.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:22.330
Zaus...

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:25.050
So you didn't die...

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.930
I thought you got even 
more scars near your eye,

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.470
but it seems you're in league with <i>him</i>.

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:36.070
There are five winners in the 
history of the Cooking Fest.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.520
Me, Zaus,

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:41.480
Yuda, Brunch, and Chiyo...

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:44.140
But there's actually one more person.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:49.490
A chef who only participated 
in the first Fest and won.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:50.460
This is news to me.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:55.460
After the tournament, it was 
discovered that he broke many rules.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:59.760
He was banished from the 
cooking world for eternity

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:02.540
and buried in the pages of history.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.570
His name is Joie.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:10.450
He's called the Chef of Darkness.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:14.910
Now, his name is forgotten,

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:18.220
but I've heard a few dark whisperings.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.360
Zaus...

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:23.190
Joie is the one who gave 
you those scars, isn't he?

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:26.970
Even someone like you let his guard down...

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.460
My guard?

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:31.030
Talk about letting one's guard down...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.300
Setsu-san...

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.870
That's what this is.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:40.900
Chiyo!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:42.970
Zaus!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:44.290
You bastard!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.510
Chiyo...

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:47.780
Eventually, you would've 
gotten in the way too.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:50.850
Instead, I think you'll retire here.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.040
Dark Art!

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:54.150
Calorie Consumption!

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.450
Chiyo!

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:08.940
So you've finally shown your true colors.

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:13.130
Taking advantage of the battle 
between IGO and Gourmet Corp.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.150
and plunging the world into chaos,

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.510
that's the work of your organization.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.130
I assume you're after GOD?

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.220
You've contrived to profit 
from their quarrel.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:26.570
GOD and beyond that...

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.750
Setsu-san...

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.910
The place we seek...

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:34.790
Why don't you come with us?

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:39.530
You'd do well not to raise 
my blood pressure any higher!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:44.050
I'm sure you at least want 
time to regret your actions!

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.710
Yes. I'm finished here.

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.440
How about on your side?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:54.910
Yes.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.790
Oh, is that right?

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.140
The president, huh?

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.720
Why not just kill him?

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.560
Conference Room

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.560
We have no more use for this place.

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:07.990
I'm leaving soon,

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.330
Shige-chan.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.470
Wanted Punch!

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.090
Shige... san...

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:39.530
Why...?

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.520
Toriko-san... Toriko-san!

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:45.820
Where are you?!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.230
Toriko-san, where...?

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.470
What's that?!

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.630
Toriko-san!

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:56.240
Toriko-sa...

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:04.080
Ow...

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.350
Toriko-sa...

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:22.130
T-

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:26.030
Toriko-san!!!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:39.570
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:45.990
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:51.530
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:56.810
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:20:57.090 --> 00:21:02.670
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:08.330
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:14.470
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:19.550
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:20.990
Mega Raba

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:23.930
Mega Raba

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.970
Mega Raba

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:34.610
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.250
Guess the Legend!

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.610
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:36.340
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:39.970
In this segment, you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:49.490
Really?! Level 4

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.820
Today's "Really?!" level is 4.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:51.090
This is silly...

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:54.560
Okay, here I go...

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:57.350
Really?! Level 4

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.930
Someone once said...

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:59.640
If you put this in your mouth,

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:02.400
you'll find yourself smiling 
and saying, "Heehee!"

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:06.110
It's made from mint and 
is something something!

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:09.030
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds. Start!

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:10.360
Mint tea!

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:11.780
Come on, too obvious.

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:12.730
Yeah, right?

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:14.070
Haha, Heehee!

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:15.920
I could say a lot of things right now...

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:17.410
Okay, then please give me a hint!

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:18.750
Hint Heehee!

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:20.270
Okay, you're out of time!

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:23.030
Someone once said...

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:34.380
Mint-heehee 
[From mantohihi, or  "hamadryas baboon" in English]

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:25.040
If you put this in your mouth,

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:27.490
you'll find yourself smiling 
and saying, "Heehee!"

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:30.110
It's made from mint and is...

00:22:30.110 --> 00:22:31.030
Mint Heehee!

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:33.970
Hey, that's the part that 
feels the best to say!

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:36.960
Mint Heehee...

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:38.640
I wanted to do that!

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:43.970
And now let's get back on 
track with our next segment!

00:22:42.390 --> 00:22:43.970
What, you're going?
